msgid "Read and search mail, read only by default. To archive, label or draft, an app needs “{allowSuggestions}” below and “{setting}” set to “{askFirst}”. You approve every AI suggestion in OpenMail, and sending always needs your confirmation here."
msgstr "读取和搜索邮件，默认只读。应用要归档、加标签或写草稿，需要在下方点“{allowSuggestions}”，并把“{setting}”设为“{askFirst}”。每条 AI 建议都由你在 OpenMail 中批准，发送始终要在这里确认。"

#: src/renderer/src/features/settings/sections/RemoteAccessSettings.tsx
msgid "Read and send mail from your phone or another computer through your own tailnet. This Mac stays the host: mail, tokens and keys stay here, and nothing passes through OpenMail servers. OpenMail uses Tailscale Serve, which only devices on your tailnet can reach. It never uses Funnel, so the page is never on the public internet."
msgstr "通过你自己的 tailnet，在手机或另一台电脑上收发邮件。这台 Mac 仍是主机：邮件、令牌和密钥都留在这里，不经过 OpenMail 的服务器。OpenMail 使用 Tailscale Serve，只有你 tailnet 里的设备能访问。它从不使用 Funnel，所以页面不会出现在公共互联网上。"

